@startuml cpu_timing_frame_pipeline
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK JP"
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE

title T-1: Frame Pipeline タイミング (1 フレームの end-to-end ~134ms)\n横軸 ms / Phase 8 実測ベース / perf_logger.h:43-67 計測点併記

robust "📷 camera_thread" as CAM
robust "🚚 usb_thread" as USB
robust "🎛️ control_thread" as CTRL
robust "📡 gs2200m driver" as GS
concise "tx_buff[1]" as TX
concise "WiFi RF" as WIFI

@0
CAM is "DQBUF wait"
USB is "queue wait"
CTRL is IDLE
GS is IDLE
TX is FREE
WIFI is IDLE

@10
CAM is "DQBUF wait" #LightYellow
note bottom of CAM
  ts_camera_dqbuf_start (perf_logger.h:46)
  V4L2 ring buffer DQBUF (blocking)
end note

@33
CAM is "RUN: pack" #LightGreen
note bottom of CAM
  ts_camera_dqbuf_end → ts_pack_start
  ISX012 から JPEG 取得 完了
  mjpeg_pack_frame() 開始
end note

@40
CAM is "queue push"
USB is "queue pull" #LightGreen
note bottom of USB
  frame_queue_pull(g_action_queue)
  batch_packet 構築開始
end note

@45
USB is "RUN: send" #LightGreen
GS is "RUN: SPI tx" #LightYellow
TX is BUSY
note top of GS
  tcp_server_send_with_reconnect (tcp_server.c:602)
  → SPI 転送ループ開始
end note

@50
WIFI is "TX burst"
note bottom of WIFI : 802.11n 送信 (~5ms)

@100
GS is "RUN: SPI tx" #LightYellow
TX is BUSY
note top of GS
  84 回 SPI 転送 中盤 (1500B/pkt × ~84)
  構造的天井 #1: tx_buff 直列化中
end note

@130
USB is "RUN: send" #LightGreen
GS is "RUN: SPI tx" #LightYellow
TX is BUSY
WIFI is "TX burst"

@134
USB is "queue wait"
GS is IDLE
TX is FREE
WIFI is "ACK"
note bottom of USB
  tcp_server_send 完了
  Phase 8 実測平均 = 134 ms ✅
end note

@140
WIFI is IDLE
CAM is "DQBUF wait"
note bottom of CAM : 次フレーム待機

' Control thread の 100ms 周期
@100
CTRL is "RUN: PID" #LightCyan
note top of CTRL
  control_thread_func (camera_threads.c:1330)
  fps_controller_update() — 100ms 周期 / 10Hz
  queue_depth 観測 → camera_set_fps_runtime
end note

@105
CTRL is IDLE

' ==============================================================
highlight 33 to 134 #LightGreen : "正常パス (Phase 8 実測 134ms 平均)"
highlight 45 to 134 #LightYellow : "tx_buff 占有期間 (構造的天井 #1)"

@200
CAM is IDLE
USB is IDLE
GS is IDLE

legend bottom
  **計測点マッピング (perf_logger.h:43-67)**:
  • ts_frame_start = @0 (フレーム処理開始)
  • ts_camera_poll_start/end = @0-10 (poll 待機)
  • ts_camera_dqbuf_start/end = @10-33 (DQBUF ioctl)
  • ts_pack_start/end = @33-40 (mjpeg_pack_frame)
  • ts_usb_write_start/end = @45-134 (TCP send 経由)
  • ts_frame_end = @134

  **観察**:
  • 1 フレーム合計 ~134ms のうち TCP send が **89ms (66%)** を占める
  • SPI 4 MHz 律速で構造的天井 #1 が支配的
  • Q16 100ms Want は **物理的に不可** (TCP send 単独で超過)
  • control_thread (Phase 10 PID) は 100ms 周期で短時間 (~5ms) RUN
  • 実測根拠: bak/04_test_results/22_PHASE8_PERFORMANCE_ANALYSIS.md
endlegend

@enduml
